pop inusualmente intelectual, con raíces en el folk-rock y el country-rock pero contaminado por las neurosis de la época. Athens (Georgia) compite con las capitales del rock: B-52's y R.E.M., uno de los grupos de más éxito de la historia. Carolina del Norte (dB's, Windbreakers), Hoboken (Smithereens, Bongos, Tiny Lights), el nacimiento del lo-fi (Half Japanese, Violent Femmes, Beat Happening, Guided By Voices, Sebadoh), They Might Be Giants, Green, B.A.L.L., Boston (Volcano Suns, 10,000 Maniacs, Throwing Muses, Blake Babies), la Costa Oeste (Game Theory, Posies, Young Fresh Fellows) y la sátira de Ween.","color":"#f472b6","family":"Pop, power-pop y synth-pop","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#college-pop"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":119793583247012,"artist":"Beat Happening","artist_id":181866637469144,"title":"Beat Happening","year":1985,"ess":0,"yt":"CiWs2VfqPAE","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"College-pop y nacimiento del lo-fi","scene_id":243752875478949,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#college-pop","chapters":["Sección 5.10"],"pages":[[1,151,null]]},{"id":271738707977837,"artist":"Beat Happening","artist_id":181866637469144,"title":"Jamboree","year":1988,"ess":0,"yt":"HZxkDHLj8F8","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"College-pop y nacimiento del lo-fi","scene_id":243752875478949,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#college-pop","chapters":["Sección 5.10"],"pages":[[1,151,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":151,"text":"…on drums). The documentary vignettes of Halloweed Ground (1984) upped the ante, and The Blind Leading The Naked (1986) aimed at mainstream pop. Beat Happening was the trio led by Calvin Johnson, a living institution of the Olympia scene. The minimal, handicapped folk music of Beat Happening (1985) and Jamboree (1988) encouraged hundreds of kids around the country to play primitive rock music, no matter how inept the musicians. Johnson…"},{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":245,"text":"…classic pop. USA, 1990-94 The legacy of lo-fi pop was felt much stronger in and around the American colleges. Olympia, near Seattle, ruled by Beat Happening, boasted the most fertile scene: Al Larsen's Some Velvet Sidewalk, the Kicking Giants, Lync (Sam Jayne's band, that later evolved into Love As…"},{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":267,"text":"…\"do it yourself\" infrastructure: it was not difficult for these girls to began releasing their own cassettes and CDs (e.g., via the label founded by Beat Happening's Calvin Johnson). In nearby Vancouver, anarchic poetess Jean Smith had formed Mecca Normal in the mid-1980s to create polemic works such as Calico…"}],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":119793583247012,"type":"album","name":"Beat Happening","work_year":1985,"list_id":10053931114450,"list":"Pitchfork: The 200 Best Albums of the 1980s","src":"charts","rank":122,"year":1985,"note":null,"yt":"CiWs2VfqPAE","scaruffi":null},{"id":119793583247012,"type":"album","name":"Beat Happening","list_id":251973115798518,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Twee Pop","src":"musthear","rank":118,"year":1985,"note":null,"yt":"CiWs2VfqPAE","scaruffi":null},{"id":119793583247012,"type":"album","name":"Beat Happening","list_id":239568229474880,"list":"The Definitive /mu/ Essentials","src":"musthear","rank":37,"year":1985,"note":null,"yt":"CiWs2VfqPAE","scaruffi":null},{"id":271738707977837,"type":"album","name":"Jamboree","list_id":198686658475555,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Cuddlecore","src":"musthear","rank":24,"year":1988,"note":null,"yt":"Eaw-zW7RVus","scaruffi":null},{"id":271738707977837,"type":"album","name